        "original_id": "2b82dde1-fd26-52c3-8991-742988498c56",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: San Diego, Downtown San Diego, Las Vegas Valley, Nevada, California, United States\n- Organizations: U.S. Coast Guard\n- Systems: IATA, ICAO, FAA LID\n- Products: San Diego International Airport, McCarran International Airport, Coast Guard Air Station San Diego\n\nFacts:\n- San Diego International Airport, formerly known as Lindbergh Field, is an international airport located 3 miles northwest of Downtown San Diego, California, United States.\n- San Diego International Airport has the codes IATA SAN, ICAO KSAN, and FAA LID SAN.\n- McCarran International Airport is the primary commercial airport serving the Las Vegas Valley in Nevada.\n- McCarran International Airport has the codes IATA LAS, ICAO KLAS, and FAA LID LAS.\n- U.S. Coast Guard Air Station San Diego is a Coast Guard Air Station based in San Diego, California, United States.\n- U.S. Coast Guard Air Station San Diego is located across the street from San Diego International Airport.",
